Folds a single dimension of your weapons (or ammo) upon itself, adding [16, 35, 49, 61, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage to your strikes.

Additionally you have a [6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] chance to gain 10% of a turn when your weapons hit.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
